Dolphy App Plugin: Hotspot Network Inspector & Silent Client Identifier
Compatible with Dolphy 2.5+ (Chaquopy Python 3.11 Runtime)
Version 1.2.0 - Features Primary Shizuku Kernel Polling & Secondary Passive/Active Auto-Probing
"""

__id__ = "hotspot_inspector"
